          <MomentumNarrative {...narrativeProps}>
            <p>
              Behind every event, chapter, and member of our network is an
              opportunity for a conversation, introduction, or shared experience
              that has helped Harvard alumni in tech move forward.
            </p>
            <blockquote>
              <p>
                Sometimes, the most meaningful opportunities begin with a single
